WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:15.790
Danny: We did it!

2
00:00:15.791 --> 00:00:18.340
What an amazing rescue!

3
00:00:18.341 --> 00:00:21.520
Brad: I'm just glad it's over.

4
00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:24.298
Dave: It feels good to be free again.

5
00:00:24.299 --> 00:00:34.210
Tina: Quick, let's get out of here.

6
00:00:34.211 --> 00:00:40.729
Bello: We should be safe in here.

7
00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:43.326
Chuck: I'm not so sure we're safe.

8
00:00:43.327 --> 00:00:44.741
Dave: Why not?

9
00:00:44.742 --> 00:00:46.268
Chuck: Look at him.

10
00:00:46.269 --> 00:00:49.692
What is he?

11
00:00:49.693 --> 00:00:52.088
Danny: What are you two whispering about?

12
00:00:52.089 --> 00:00:55.323
Dave: We want to know who the monster is!

13
00:00:55.324 --> 00:00:57.371
Brad: He's not a monster.

14
00:00:57.372 --> 00:01:00.962
Danny: Brad's right.

15
00:01:00.963 --> 00:01:03.884
Danny: He's a giant from Ginormous.

16
00:01:03.885 --> 00:01:07.329
Danny: I told you about him, but you didn't believe me!

17
00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:09.924
Chuck: He doesn't look like a giant.

18
00:01:09.925 --> 00:01:15.580
Dave: He looks like a monster.

19
00:01:15.581 --> 00:01:17.195
Danny: Don't be stupid.

20
00:01:17.196 --> 00:01:19.681
Bello is not a freak.

21
00:01:19.682 --> 00:01:23.351
Dave: Who did you call a monster?

22
00:01:23.352 --> 00:01:27.117
Bello: Please, everybody stop.

23
00:01:27.118 --> 00:01:30.762
Danny: I called you stupid, you idiot!

24
00:01:30.763 --> 00:01:36.584
Chuck: Just because you rescued us doesn't mean I can't beat you up!

25
00:01:36.585 --> 00:01:38.184
Brad: Try it!

26
00:01:38.185 --> 00:01:40.161
Dave: Did you say, "Try it"?

27
00:01:40.162 --> 00:01:50.305
Danny: That's what he said. Try it.

28
00:01:50.306 --> 00:01:53.809
Tina: Bello, are you okay?

29
00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:55.947
Bello: My color is fading.

30
00:01:55.948 --> 00:01:58.091
The boys shouldn't fight.

31
00:01:58.092 --> 00:02:01.991
Bello: It's making me sad.

32
00:02:01.992 --> 00:02:04.092
Chuck: I'll get you for that!

33
00:02:04.093 --> 00:02:08.267
Danny: Ow! I'll get you back!

34
00:02:08.268 --> 00:02:10.591
Tina: Danny, Brad! Stop.

35
00:02:10.592 --> 00:02:18.301
Look at what you're doing to Bello!

36
00:02:18.302 --> 00:02:22.811
Bello: Stop!

37
00:02:22.812 --> 00:02:25.972
Chuck: Okay, okay. We stopped.

38
00:02:25.973 --> 00:02:29.780
Brad: We're sorry, Bello.

39
00:02:29.781 --> 00:02:32.894
Dave: Hey, what happened to his color?

40
00:02:32.895 --> 00:02:36.199
Bello: My color is fading because of your fighting!

41
00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.646
Bello: Danny was telling the truth.

42
00:02:38.647 --> 00:02:41.860
I am a giant from the land of Ginormous.

43
00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:49.523
Bello: Danny, Tina, and Brad rescued our world from an evil magician [n3@who was stealing our color.

44
00:02:49.524 --> 00:02:55.412
Bello: Since then, whenever we see evil, it makes our color fade.

45
00:02:55.413 --> 00:02:58.145
Chuck: Whoa.

46
00:02:58.146 --> 00:03:00.771
Danny: We're sorry, Bello.

47
00:03:00.772 --> 00:03:04.003
Bello: My father told me about Tristay's hatred.

48
00:03:04.004 --> 00:03:07.781
Bello: He told me how it almost destroyed everything we loved.

49
00:03:07.782 --> 00:03:11.672
Bello: I will not watch it happen to my friends.

50
00:03:11.673 --> 00:03:14.935
Danny: I can't believe I made you lose your color.

51
00:03:14.936 --> 00:03:17.452
Danny: I can't believe that I hurt you.

52
00:03:17.453 --> 00:03:24.348
Brad: Me too, Bello.

53
00:03:24.349 --> 00:03:28.987
Bello: When we return to normal size, you will see that I am a giant.

54
00:03:28.988 --> 00:03:33.142
Bello: Then I will return to my home, and you will to yours.

55
00:03:33.143 --> 00:03:35.541
Bello: That is our mission now.

56
00:03:35.542 --> 00:03:41.544
Chuck: The hugging was gross, but seeing your color [n3@come back was totally cool.

57
00:03:41.545 --> 00:03:44.118
Tina: Didn't you hear what Bello said?

58
00:03:44.119 --> 00:03:45.895
We have a mission.

59
00:03:45.896 --> 00:03:48.847
Tina: It's time to work together.

60
00:03:48.848 --> 00:03:55.105
Dave: Whatever. I'm not hugging anybody.
